WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.129 --> 00:00:05.189
It's very interesting [I] was worth

00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:11.309
about over a million dollars when I was 23 and

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:17.010
Over ten million dollars when I was 24 and over a hundred million dollars when I was 25

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.640
and

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.990
it

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:24.990
Wasn't that important?

00:00:25.269 --> 00:00:27.269
Because I never did it for the money

00:00:27.699 --> 00:00:29.699
I

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.920
I

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:39.238
think money is wonderful thing because it enables you to do things it enables you to invest in ideas that don't have a

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:41.669
Short-term Payback and things like that, but

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.129
Especially at that point in my life

00:00:44.129 --> 00:00:48.059
It was it was not the most important thing the most important thing was [the] company

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:53.219
The people the products we were making what we were going to enable people to do with these products

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:58.709
So I didn't think about it a great deal, and I never sold any stock and just

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:03.479
Really believed that the company would would do very well over the long term

